/-!
# The intrinsic Baby Monster presentation

The carrier `BabyMonster.Carrier` is the quotient of a free group on eleven
letters by the explicit `Y₄₃₃` relations. Its group structure, canonical
generators, defining equations, universal property, and perfectness are
re-exported here. The construction uses the presentation in §3.1 of
Breuer–Magaard–Wilson, *Verification of the ordinary character table of the
Baby Monster*, J. Algebra 534 (2019), https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.07758.

Finiteness, the order calculation, and simplicity are not asserted by the
presentation or perfectness results in these imports.
-/
